MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- scripts/run-phase-lib.sh — shared safety/session mechanics for the four
  AI-CLI adapters. Keeps each adapter's tool-specific CLI invocation
  intact; only the common guardrails (log dir, prompts, subject
  extraction, safe staging, commit+push with stop-on-push-failure) move
  into the library. Intent documented in the file header so the four
  adapters stay separate.

- Safe staging replaces `git add -A` in all four run-phase-*.sh scripts.
  Stages only files git considers changed this session. Refuses
  fail-closed to stage anything matching the sensitive-path patterns
  (.env*, .ssh/, .aws/, .azure/, .gcp/, *.pem/*.key/*.crt, credentials*,
  secrets*, id_rsa, *.sqlite*, *.db, *.dump, *.bak, etc.). Prints a
  status summary before commit. Optional RUN_PHASE_ALLOWLIST_REGEX
  tightens further; RUN_PHASE_FORCE_UNSAFE=1 overrides loudly.
  Unattended push behavior + Git-Rule stop-on-push-failure unchanged.

- scripts/lint-planning.py — Python-stdlib planning linter. Verifies
  every task in TASKS.md has the AI_RULES Task-Quality subsections
  (Goal, Prerequisites, Scope Included/Excluded, Acceptance Criteria,
  Verification, Test Requirements, Security/Cost Considerations,
  Rollback/Recovery, Known Blockers, Dev Environment Constraints,
  Handoff Notes) plus header fields (Status, Owner, Priority); every
  ADR in DECISIONS.md has Date, Status, Decision, Reason, Tradeoffs,
  Related Tasks; every planning file has Last Updated; line caps for
  CURRENT_STATE.md (≤80) and HANDOFF.md (≤50) hold.

- .github/workflows/lint.yml — CI runs shellcheck on the four phase
  scripts + shared lib, and runs the planning linter on every push / PR.

- docs/CHOOSING_WEBAPP_PATH.md — web-app decision tree with Mermaid
  diagrams covering static / docs / SPA / CRUD / SaaS / e-commerce /
  marketplace / AI / realtime / internal / public / private /
  sensitive surfaces, plus the cross-cutting axes (auth, user data,
  payments, external APIs incl. AI cost, realtime, admin, deployment
  shape). Linked from README.

- Version bumped 0.5.5 → 0.6.0 (minor — features + guardrails, no
  breaking changes). CHANGELOG, ai/HANDOFF.md, ai/CURRENT_STATE.md
  updated to reflect the new state.

Tests/checks run:
- bash -n on all four scripts + shared lib (clean)
- shellcheck 0.11.0 on all four scripts + shared lib (clean)
- python3 scripts/lint-planning.py (0 errors, 0 warnings)
- python3 -m py_compile scripts/lint-planning.py (clean)
- python -c yaml.safe_load on .github/workflows/lint.yml (valid)
- End-to-end test of rpl_safe_stage in a temp git repo: refuses
  sensitive paths fail-closed; stages only session changes; allowlist
  filter works; empty changeset returns rc=2.
